hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"404","Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-Jabbar al-Hamadhani narrated to us, Musa ibn Dawud narrated to us, Sallam ibn Miskin narrated to us, from al-Hasan, he said: Some people fought with stones and a slain man was found among them, so the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) ordered their detention, then he related the hadith."
